From 2c7a9b9185e798d5636af1b22cc8c89a257aaeb4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jeebuscrossaint <thediamond270@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 22:12:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 25/29] patch: vanitygaps - inner/outer gaps, per-side

Conflicts: vanitygaps and cfact both rewrite tile(). Hand-merged tile() so it
does gaps AND cfact weights: gaps are subtracted first, then the remaining
height is distributed by each client's cweight.
Dropped vanitygaps' Mod+y/o/Y/O gap binds (they collide with the dwindle and
bstackhoriz layout keys); kept its 10 LOGO-modified binds.
---
 config.def.h |  16 +++++
 dwl.c        | 171 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 172 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/config.def.h b/config.def.h
index 9f298cc..17b94c1 100644
--- a/config.def.h
+++ b/config.def.h
@@ -6,12 +6,18 @@
